        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into another dimension with YogLabs: Testing Initiative - where chaos brews and experiments never go as planned. You awaken as a freshly cloned copy of Honeydew, thrown into an unusual testing course of dangerous challenges. Can you survive the trials before disaster strikes and everything unravels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962400/extras/c29d22ebce1088603a470747919d0bcf.avif?t=1786035915\" width=1560 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone! My name is Sergio, and Elsewhere is a game I’ve been developing since 2012. Since late 2018, I’ve been working on it nearly full-time. All code for the game is done by me, while the art assets are either done by me or by my more talented artist friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve been a fan of the Yogscast for many years, and the core idea behind Elsewhere is to create a fully standalone game where players can embark on adventures reminiscent of classic Let’s Play series such as Jaffa Factory, Voltz, Moon Quest, and Hole Diggers, to name just a few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So here’s my fan-made YogLabs adventure! I built everything myself and I hope you enjoy playing through it as much as I enjoyed making it! I would love to be able to add new episodes to the game (the 3rd one is on its way) so please show your support by checking out Elsewhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962400/extras/620a8bdf342b3fec69ef35f7a65d44c8.avif?t=1786035915\" width=1560 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes many references, jokes and secrets. Take your time and explore the lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛏️ Explore the facility as Honeydew and cause trouble as you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Notice some familiar guest voices to guide you through the puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐱 Play mini-games and find secrets - can you collect all the Jaffas?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❔ Complete the Testing Course and/or blow stuff up (optional)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌑 Go to the Moon and discover a horrible secret</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 YogLabs: Testing Initiative is a fan project and all Yogscast-related content is used with permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into another dimension with YogLabs: Testing Initiative - where chaos brews and experiments never go as planned. You awaken as a freshly cloned copy of Honeydew, thrown into an unusual testing course of dangerous challenges. Can you survive the trials before disaster strikes and everything unravels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962400/extras/c29d22ebce1088603a470747919d0bcf.avif?t=1786035915\" width=1560 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone! My name is Sergio, and Elsewhere is a game I’ve been developing since 2012. Since late 2018, I’ve been working on it nearly full-time. All code for the game is done by me, while the art assets are either done by me or by my more talented artist friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve been a fan of the Yogscast for many years, and the core idea behind Elsewhere is to create a fully standalone game where players can embark on adventures reminiscent of classic Let’s Play series such as Jaffa Factory, Voltz, Moon Quest, and Hole Diggers, to name just a few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So here’s my fan-made YogLabs adventure! I built everything myself and I hope you enjoy playing through it as much as I enjoyed making it! I would love to be able to add new episodes to the game (the 3rd one is on its way) so please show your support by checking out Elsewhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962400/extras/620a8bdf342b3fec69ef35f7a65d44c8.avif?t=1786035915\" width=1560 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes many references, jokes and secrets. Take your time and explore the lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛏️ Explore the facility as Honeydew and cause trouble as you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Notice some familiar guest voices to guide you through the puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐱 Play mini-games and find secrets - can you collect all the Jaffas?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❔ Complete the Testing Course and/or blow stuff up (optional)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌑 Go to the Moon and discover a horrible secret</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 YogLabs: Testing Initiative is a fan project and all Yogscast-related content is used with permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A unique puzzle-adventure set in the secret YogLabs research facility. As a newly created clone, you’ll face a series of challenges while disaster threatens to consume the laboratory.",
